# LinkedIn Sales Navigator Authentication Credentials
# Obtain these from your active browser session:
# 1. Open DevTools (F12) -> Application -> Cookies -> https://www.linkedin.com
# 2. Copy the value of 'li_at'
# 3. Copy the value of 'JSESSIONID' (keep the quotes if it starts with 'ajax:')
# 4. Copy the value of 'li_a' (Sales Navigator seat; required for Sales Navigator searches)

LI_AT=your_li_at_cookie_here
JSESSIONID="ajax:your_jsessionid_here"
LI_A=your_li_a_cookie_here
